      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-26T14:26:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The \"each individual power may only be used once per turn\" rule has been important since day one, as Legacy using The Legacy Ring to \"Galvanize\" twice is pretty ridiculous and way over-powered. One of the reasons The Argent Adept is considered a higher difficulty hero is that he specifically plays off that rule.&nbsp;</p>",
